@page "/"

<PageTitle>DogsInfo - Home</PageTitle>

<div class="text-center mb-5">
    <h1>Welcome to DogsInfo</h1>
    <p class="lead">Your comprehensive guide to dog breeds and common canine health issues.</p>
</div>

<div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 g-4">
    <div class="col">
        <div class="card h-100 border-primary">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2 class="card-title h4">🐕 Dog Breeds</h2>
                <p class="card-text">Explore our collection of popular dog breeds from around the world. Learn about their origins, sizes, and temperaments to find the perfect companion.</p>
                <a href="breeds" class="btn btn-primary">Browse Breeds</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col">
        <div class="card h-100 border-warning">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2 class="card-title h4">🏥 Dog Diseases</h2>
                <p class="card-text">Learn about common health issues that can affect dogs. Understand the symptoms, severity, and recommended actions to keep your furry friend healthy.</p>
                <a href="diseases" class="btn btn-warning">View Diseases</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="mt-5 p-4 bg-light rounded">
    <h3>About This App</h3>
    <p>DogsInfo is a simple informational resource for dog lovers. Whether you're considering getting a new dog or want to learn more about canine health, this app provides easy-to-understand information at your fingertips.</p>
    <p class="mb-0"><strong>Note:</strong> This information is for educational purposes only. Always consult with a licensed veterinarian for professional medical advice for your pet.</p>
</div>
